NO FINITE-SAMPLE GUARANTEE ON EBOLA: NO finite-sample guarantee on Ebola: lambda_h is fitted on other diseases and TRANSFERRED. The guarantee comes from ACI's online adaptation, not from this initialisation.

+ACI is LAG-1: it feeds the outcome of origin t into the alpha used at t+1, but a h-step forecast is not resolved until t+h, so at h=3/5/10/15 that outcome is 2/4/9/14 weeks of future truth. Label it RETROSPECTIVE / oracle-feedback.
+ACIlag is the honest stream (update at t from origins <= t-h). `upd` is how many of the T origins ever adapted; the rest ran at alpha_1 = 0.1. Report the +lam and +ACIlag columns; the gap to +ACI is the size of the oracle.
